      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果是北部玄驹的话，\n或许真的能够\n正面挑战这样恶劣的状况也不一定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e08498423d3a4b8b23fe366a2c343916401fc919156e04091de007b89f2a4dc",
