      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了鼓励身负重任，\n承受庞大压力的北部玄驹，\n历任的赢家来到了她的身边。",
      "source_fingerprint": "109766b3d90b58f9a130d43e280bba8f4c32c4c516a18e694a69e06a9d6a081e",
